# LifeLink Trivy Vulnerability Scanner Ignore File
# Documented and justified upstream exceptions (Page 15 of roadmap)

# CVE-2026-65182: Embedded Tomcat security constraint bypass in FORM/DIGEST auth.
# Justification: LifeLink does not use Servlet FORM/DIGEST auth; it uses stateless Spring Security JWT Bearer filters.
CVE-2026-65182

# CVE-2026-65637: Embedded Tomcat HTTP/2 no-authority bypass.
# Justification: LifeLink terminates TLS and HTTP/2 at the outer reverse proxy (Caddy/Nginx) and proxies plain HTTP/1.1 to the backend.
CVE-2026-65637

# CVE-2026-65905: Embedded Tomcat authentication bypass via replay attack in DIGEST authenticator.
# Justification: DIGEST authentication is disabled; user credentials are verified with BCrypt in UserService.
CVE-2026-65905

# CVE-2026-68525: Embedded Tomcat unauthorized resource access via FORM authentication bypass.
# Justification: FORM authentication is disabled; authentication is handled via custom REST /api/auth/login endpoints.
CVE-2026-68525
